=2 Walkthrough
* Trade {n:Ququroon} all of the fish he desires.
* There is a small chance that {n:Ququroon} will fail to make the stew. If this happens, do not panic. The quest will still be considered to be completed.

* This quest is repeatable once every real life minute.

* This quest must be completed during the {q:Rat Race|Rat Race|Rat Race} quest, though it is not a prerequisite for that quest. You can flag {q:Rat Race|Rat Race|Rat Race} immediately with no knowledge of this quest.

* If you complete this quest prior to being to the part of {q:Rat Race|Rat Race|Rat Race} where you need a {i:Nashmau Stew|Nashmau Stew|5595}, you will need to do this quest yet again.

